Z||000009||Archie||12-23-2000||09:07 AM||||I think the 4.3 is about as big of a <BR>V-6 as you will find.<P>I read on the Internet the GM had modified the 4.3 and added 2 cylinders and is calling it a 5.7. I know it's true, because I saw it on the Internet.<P> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"> Archie||||reg||12
